		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4523&amp;p=33708#p33708"><![CDATA[
A new version of the OpenGD77CPS is now available<br><br>See<br><br><a href="https://www.opengd77.com/downloads/PC_CPS/Latest/OpenGD77CPSInstaller_R2024.10.26.01.exe" class="postlink">downloads/PC_CPS/Latest/OpenGD77CPSInst ... .26.01.exe</a> <br><br><br>This version fixes a crash bug, if the band limit text boxes were left empty<br><br>If a box is left empty, it will change to the highest or lowest value which is applicable for the band limit e.g. if the VHF minimum box is left empty it will be changed to the minimum possible frequency.  If the UHF maximum frequency box is left empty, it will be set to the maximum supported UHF frequency etc<br>This is generally similar to what the frequency boxes, do on the Channel screen<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Sat Oct 26, 2024 3:03 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
